SUMMARY:Yallah! Muslims: Gather. Write. Repeat.
DESCRIPTION:Yallah! Muslims: Gather. Write. Repeat is a generative writing workshop for self-identifying Muslim artists to join together in a fun\, supportive\, and imaginative community space—let’s dream big and get to know each other. \nEach session will begin with a group check-in\, followed by a series of fresh and playful generative free-writing prompts (all original)\, alternated with optional sharing and group connection. It’s a no-judgment zone—the focus is creativity and joy! \n“The birds are free from the cage; the cage is empty of the birds.” — Jalal al-Din Rumi\, translated by Nader Khalili
URL:https://literary-arts.org/event/yallah-muslims-gather-write-repeat/
CATEGORIES:Writing Classes,Online Class
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://literary-arts.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Classes26_WebGraphics_600x900_Fillable-1.png
